  "$comment": "Cases for web/depends.js, written before it. `where` cases: one address in, where it lives out. `rows` cases: what was read from a collection in, the rows of the detail view's 'Depends on' list out. Each expected row names its label, its state (chain: on chain; pinned: named by its own hash on IPFS or Arweave; host: a server someone runs; open: nothing off chain, but the owner can change it; unknown: not read), and words its text must contain. `absent` lists labels that must not appear. The facts under `from` are what the named collection returned on 2026-11-21.",
